 best but also with fully customisable vehicles. Whether you're tweaking the headlight colour, installing hydraulics for jumps, or kitting out your ride with NOS, the possibilities are endless, with millions of part combinations. Unlock new parts by jacking and crushing cars around the city, then bring them back to your garage to build the wildest ride Rockhaven has ever seen. Just remember - without a seatbelt, crashing will send you flying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1415220/extras/a3f5e67d3ddc8b55ffc112f28b26fc77.poster.avif?t=1729524607\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1415220/extras/a3f5e67d3ddc8b55ffc112f28b26fc77.webm?t=1729524607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><strong>It's Only Money</strong> is a playground for you and up to three friends. Steal together, fight together, and complete missions together - or just hang out in the Slimeway and gamble away your hard-earned cash on snail racing. If competition is more your style, dive into various PvP microgames like Prop Hunt or Gorb Rush, where you're thrown into a giant orb and tasked with being the last one standing on a sky high platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1415220/extras/5bee380ae4dc02779e9119c94d77d607.poster.avif?t=1729524607\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1415220/extras/5bee380ae4dc02779e9119c94d77d607.webm?t=1729524607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>With tons of new content, including expanded player upgrades, new missions, and enhanced vehicle systems, Rockhaven is yours to take back. The Mayor took everything from you - now it\u2019s time for payback.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the ride, cause chaos, and, most importantly, reclaim what's yours.</p>",
    "short_description": "The mayor of Rockhaven threw you down a hole into the Undercity. Why? Net worth too low. In this open-world simulation, you and up to 3 pals will steal, fight, and scheme to reclaim the city. Customise your rides, buy businesses, and take on the Mayor\u2019s forces. Rockhaven is yours for the taking!",
